  "title": "Fresh Strawberry Sauce",
  "description": "This fresh strawberry sauce is enhanced with a splash of balsamic vinegar; perfect to use in pies, as a filling for cakes, or to drizzle over cheesecake.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
